# Wireframe frame around the MAXI logo.
# Source: apps/zig/scenes/maxi.zig (vertices_rectangle, segments_rectangle).
# Original: MAXI's 3D line boot, The Replicants & ST Amigos crack (Atari ST).
# Vertices are f32-exact: they parse back to the original table's bits.
o maxi_rectangle
v -0.02 -0.02 0
v 2.4 -0.02 0
v 2.4 0.6 0
v -0.02 0.6 0
l 1 2 3 4 1
